  answer: Vern Gosdin
  acceptedAnswers:
  - Vern Gosdin
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABIf You're Gonna Do Me Wrong, Do It Right\xBB,
    de 1983, y llega hasta 1994."
  - "Se mueve dentro de traditional country; \xABI Can Tell by the Way You Dance
    (You're Gonna Love Me Tonight)\xBB refleja una energ\xEDa suave y un pulso cercano
    a 123 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABMother Country Music\xBB y \xABDim Lights,
    Thick Smoke (And Loud, Loud Music)\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABChiseled In Stone\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABSet 'Em Up Joe\xBB y \xABTill the End\xBB."
